Thanks, Len and Eric. I think my conclusion from your comments is that, as a practical matter, the simultaneous use of covariates and adjustment terms became fully supported in the mrds package in December 2023, but that there is still the practical concern of ensuring monotonicity, as well as the theoretical/philosophical question of what the adjustment terms are intended to achieve (e.g. allowing different shaped key functions as a matter of principle, or accounting for deviations from the key function resulting from ineffective covariates). If anyone has other thoughts, please let me know!

Best,
Jason

